        "line": 73,
        "text": "theorem physical_q_bound {h : ℝ} (hh : 0 < h) (hh1 : h < 1/2) {p : SimilarityProfile.PhysicalPoint} (ht : p.1 < 1) : SimilarityProfile.q h p ≤ 2 * (1 - p.1) + (2 * p.2.2 ^ 2) ^ (1 - 2 * h)⁻¹"
